    <section id="announcements" class="announcement-bar" aria-label="Conference announcements" data-announcements data-interval="8"><div class="container announcement-inner"><div class="announcement-messages" aria-live="off"><p class="announcement-item" data-countdown data-start="2027-10-13" data-end="2027-10-14" data-date="13–14 October 2027" data-city="Budapest">321 days to go · 13–14 October 2027 · Budapest</p><p class="announcement-item" hidden><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/135228223" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow us on LinkedIn</a></p></div><div class="announcement-controls" hidden><button type="button" data-announcement-pause aria-label="Pause announcements" aria-pressed="false" title="Pause announcements"><span aria-hidden="true">Ⅱ</span></button></div></div></section>
    <section id="about" class="section about-section"><div class="container about-grid">
  <div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">The conference</p><h2>Ticketing. Payments.<br><span>People.</span></h2><p class="lead">What is The Budapest Exchange?</p><p class="about-opening">An international conference in Budapest on digital ticketing, payments and the practical challenges of running better public transport.</p><ul class="about-highlights"><li><h3>Ticketing, payments &amp; mobility</h3><p>Contactless fares, digital wallets and connected journeys — alongside AI, cybersecurity and accessible passenger services.</p></li><li><h3>Ideas tested in practice</h3><p>Discuss integration with existing systems, rollout decisions and everyday operation. Compare what worked, what did not and what could transfer to your network.</p></li><li><h3>Connections beyond the sessions</h3><p>Exchange experience with transport authorities, operators, payment providers and technology companies from across Europe — in the sessions and beyond.</p></li></ul><div class="about-proof"><p><strong>2026 speakers included</strong> BKK, ATM Barcelona, Rejsekort &amp; Rejseplan, FAIRTIQ, Wizz Air and many more.</p></div><a class="inline-link" data-programme-link-target="topics" href="#programme">Take a look at the programme</a></div>
  <div class="about-images"><img class="about-main" src="/assets/images/conference-08.jpg" alt="Delegates sharing a light-hearted moment during the 2026 conference" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 50%"><img class="about-detail" src="/media.php?id=b292a21103a49dd1f66101cf65eb583a" alt="Two colleagues talking over coffee at the 2026 event" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 50%"><span class="photo-label">In conversation. <br>Budapest, 2026.</span></div>
</div></section>

