    <section id="programme" class="section programme-section"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The programme</p><h2>What we talk about</h2></div><p class="heading-aside">Take a look at the 2027 Thematic Headlines and the summary of the subjects covered in 2026,<br>while we prepare the next programme.</p></div>
  <p class="thematic-label">Thematic Headlines · 2027</p>
    <div class="programme-status"><span class="status-dot"></span><p><strong>Detailed programme to be announced.</strong> In the meantime, here are the Thematic Headlines for 2027</p></div>
    <div class="topic-grid"><div class="topic-column"><article class="compact-topic"><details><summary><span class="topic-number">01</span><h3>AI &amp; Transport</h3><span class="topic-expand" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="topic-description"><p>Where can AI make a real difference in public transport, from predicting demand to keeping passengers informed when things go wrong?</p><span class="topic-tag">ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE · TRANSPORT OPERATIONS · PASSENGER INFORMATION</span></div></details></article><article class="compact-topic"><details><summary><span class="topic-number">02</span><h3>Cybersecurity</h3><span class="topic-expand" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="topic-description"><p>What challenges does the public transport sector face in terms of cybersecurity?</p><span class="topic-tag">Security · IT</span></div></details></article><article class="compact-topic"><details><summary><span class="topic-number">03</span><h3>Accessibility &amp; Inclusive Design</h3><span class="topic-expand" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="topic-description"><p>How can we design apps,  ticket machines and passenger information to allow upfront  for a better customer experience?</p><span class="topic-tag">ACCESSIBILITY · INCLUSIVE DESIGN · PASSENGER EXPERIENCE</span></div></details></article></div><div class="topic-column"><article class="compact-topic"><details><summary><span class="topic-number">04</span><h3>Ticketing, Payments, Banking</h3><span class="topic-expand" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="topic-description"><p>How are ticketing schemes, digital payments and banking partnerships shaping mobility? Explore new ways to pay and create value for passengers and operators.</p><span class="topic-tag">ACCOUNT-BASED TICKETING · DIGITAL WALLETS · BANKING PARTNERSHIPS · MOBILITY FINANCE</span></div></details></article><article class="compact-topic"><details><summary><span class="topic-number">05</span><h3>Blockchain &amp;<br>
Crypto</h3><span class="topic-expand" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="topic-description"><p>What can blockchain add to ticketing? Is it a solution or just another complication?</p><span class="topic-tag">Blockchain · crypto</span></div></details></article><article class="compact-topic"><details><summary><span class="topic-number">06</span><h3>Connected Mobility</h3><span class="topic-expand" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="topic-description"><p>How can we better integrate planning and booking of journeys across different operators, modes of transport and borders by keeping users always informed?</p><span class="topic-tag">MULTIMODAL TRAVEL · INTEROPERABILITY · CROSS-BORDER MOBILITY</span></div></details></article></div></div>
    <div class="programme-bottom"><span></span><a class="inline-link" href="mailto:info@thebudapestexchange.com?subject=The%20Budapest%20Exchange%202027%20%E2%80%94%20speaking%20enquiry">Interested in speaking?</a></div>
    <div class="button-row programme-links"><a class="button button-outline thematic-programme-link programme-archive-link" href="/programme/?edition=2026">Revisit the 2026 programme</a></div>
</div></section>

    
