rrer"><div class="speaker-portrait"><span class="speaker-initials" aria-hidden="true">GC</span></div><div class="speaker-copy"><p class="speaker-org">Calypso Networks Association; AVM Venice</p><h3>Gianluca Cuzzolin</h3><p class="speaker-role">Chairman (Calypso Networks Association); Sustainable Transition and Innovative Projects Director (AVM Venice)</p></div></a></div><div class="speakers-more"><a class="button button-outline" href="/speakers.php?edition=2026">View all speakers</a><p>29 speakers · 2026 edition</p></div><p class="small-note">Names, roles and organisations refer to the 2026 programme. Select a speaker to visit their LinkedIn profile (online).</p>
