<dialog id="privacy-dialog" class="info-dialog" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
<form method="dialog"><button class="icon-button close-info" aria-label="Close privacy information">×</button></form>
<p class="eyebrow">Privacy information</p>
<h2 id="privacy-title">Your privacy</h2>
<p>This website is operated by Strigiformes Kft., organiser of The Budapest Exchange. For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:info@thebudapestexchange.com">info@thebudapestexchange.com</a>.</p>
<p>We use no advertising cookies, analytics cookies or client-side tracking scripts. Essential technical cookies are used where needed for secure access and administration.</p>
<p>We count page views as daily server-side totals, grouped by page and broad referral source or campaign label. These statistics do not store IP addresses, full referring URLs, browser fingerprints or visitor identifiers and do not link browsing between pages. Requests carrying Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control are excluded. Hosting access logs are separate from these statistics.</p>
<p>If you choose “Larger text”, your browser saves that display preference in local storage. It is not used to identify or track you.</p>
<p>If you request a ticket alert, read the <a href="/privacy.php#ticket-alert">ticket alert privacy notice</a> for details about your data and how to cancel.</p>
<p>Email links open your email application. If you contact us, the information you provide is used to respond to your enquiry.</p>
<p>External partner, LinkedIn and calendar links open services with their own privacy policies.</p>

</dialog>
